CMD="aider"
MARKER="\n> "
VERSION_CMD="aider --version"
BUNDLE='du -sb ~/.local/share/uv/tools/aider-chat | cut -f1'
NOTE="uv tool install pinned to aider-chat==0.86.2 (PyPI; the GitHub releases page lags) with its own CPython 3.12. Model gpt-4o at 127.0.0.1:9; update check, analytics prompt, release notes and .gitignore prompt turned off in ~/.aider.conf.yml. The cold start includes aider's first-run synchronous import warm-up (it says so with --verbose) and the litellm model table fetch from raw.githubusercontent.com; the warm number is Python import time."
